  "description": "D-RULE ULTRA – POWERFUL AND COMFORTABLE FOR LONGER RIDES\n\nThe SPARTA d-RULE ULTRA is designed for cyclists who want that extra bit of power on their commute. With the powerful Bosch Performance Line mid-motor and low-maintenance belt drive, you'll glide effortlessly and silently through the city or over longer distances.\n\nThe Enviolo City hub offers smooth, stepless shifting without the traditional fixed gears. Instead of shifting between gears, you simply turn the shifter to adjust the resistance. This makes shifting intuitive and easy, whether you're pulling away from a stoplight or maintaining a relaxed pace.\n\nThe Bosch Kiox display clearly shows your ride data and offers connectivity options. The integrated n:LIGHT lights ensure you're always clearly visible, wherever you're riding.\n\nWide tires and a suspension seatpost guarantee a stable and comfortable riding experience, even on challenging trails. Whether you need speed or simply want to enjoy a smooth ride, the d-RULE ULTRA offers the ultimate combination of power, technology, and comfort.\n\nThe retail price of this e-bike includes VAT and excludes a €4.50 battery recycling fee in the Netherlands.\nPlease note: specifications may vary. Consult the product details for the exact specifications or contact your dealer.",
